Memory Observatory

Copyright © Summon Software Labs

Memory Observatory is an open-source, vendor-neutral observability runtime for
measuring, correlating, explaining, and replaying memory behavior across
heterogeneous AI infrastructure.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Memory Observatory does not transmit any telemetry. All measurements and
telemetry are written to local files chosen by the operator and never leave
the machine running the software.

Memory Observatory accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on
the terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
